## 3. Alternative Concept & Complexity Analysis

### Time and Space Complexity Comparison Matrix

| Data Structure | Add End | Insert Front | Insert Middle | Get $k$-th | Space per Element |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **ArrayList** | $O(1)$ amortized | $O(N)$ | $O(N)$ | $O(1)$ | 4 / 8 bytes (Contiguous Object reference array) |
| **LinkedList** | $O(1)$ | $O(1)$ | $O(N)$ | $O(N)$ | 24 bytes overhead (Node object + 2 pointers) |
| **ArrayDeque** | $O(1)$ amortized | $O(1)$ amortized | N/A | N/A | 4 / 8 bytes (Circular array) |
| **Plain Array (Manual Shift)** | $O(1)$ | $O(N)$ | $O(N)$ | $O(1)$ | Compact (Primitive / reference array) |

